1
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:47,680
Stay alert.

2
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,280
Move in.

3
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:50,000
Copy that.

4
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,120
Move out.

5
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,800
For the international anti-drug mission, Operation Thunderbolt,

6
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,680
police from China and Country M

7
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,560
dispatched special task forces,

8
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:17,120
which, at 6:00 a.m. on December 17,

9
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:20,240
struck Long Zhiyuan's drug lab on the Chinese border

10
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:22,560
and the cartel's armed forces

11
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:25,199
guarding poppy plantations along Country M's border

12
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:27,240
in a simultaneous coordinated raid.

13
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:40,600
Fire!

14
00:04:59,439 --> 00:04:59,959
Move!

15
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,560
We'll go back up Captain Bai.

16
00:05:46,399 --> 00:05:48,680
The drugs originate from the Jiechan Gang,

17
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,959
enter the country through Yunxiu,

18
00:05:49,959 --> 00:05:52,600
and reach Nanhai City via Jiangyang and Yangchuan.

19
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,040
From Nanhai, they are shipped to

20
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:57,439
Zhuwan, Minchuan, Jiaogang, and Liandao.

21
00:05:57,879 --> 00:05:59,160
And our Nanhai City

22
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:02,319
has become a vital hub along this trafficking route.

23
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,319
On the seventh of this month,

24
00:06:07,519 --> 00:06:08,480
the Narcotics Division

25
00:06:08,639 --> 00:06:11,199
raided Xiangdu Entertainment Club in our city,

26
00:06:11,519 --> 00:06:13,279
arresting three drug-related suspects.

27
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,680
At the scene, we found a new type of drug:

28
00:06:15,879 --> 00:06:17,000
Psychedelic Blues.

29
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,480
Psychedelic Blues

30
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:21,519
only hit the international market this March.

31
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:24,920
Yet in Zhuwan, Minchuan, and Jiaogang,

32
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:27,240
this new drug has yet to surface.

33
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,639
We suspect that

34
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,360
the drug cartel lurking in our city

35
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,639
is contacting buyers in those regions.

36
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,160
And the coming months

37
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,680
will be our best window

38
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:38,759
to dismantle the Nanhai drug cartel.

39
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:30,240
Not bad, brother.

40
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:32,199
Real loyal.

41
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,639
I wish my boys were like you,

42
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,279
completely devoted to their big brother.

43
00:07:39,879 --> 00:07:41,759
But if you want loyalty from your men,

44
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:44,199
a boss has to play by the rules.

45
00:07:44,199 --> 00:07:44,839
Right?

46
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,439
Your boss took my goods,

47
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:49,600
promising to pay the rest in a week.

48
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,879
It's been a whole month now.

49
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,040
I haven't seen a cent,

50
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,279
and the guy's nowhere to be found.

51
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,240
Tell me,

52
00:07:58,639 --> 00:08:01,199
isn't your boss breaking the rules here?

53
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:03,480
Tell you what.

54
00:08:05,279 --> 00:08:06,920
Let me show you a way out.

55
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:10,040
Just admit Wu Liang is your boss,

56
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,759
and not only will I let you go,

57
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:15,040
I'll pave your way to riches.

58
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:16,439
Sound good?

59
00:08:17,319 --> 00:08:18,279
I don't know, man.

60
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:20,959
I really don't!

61
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,120
Is that so?

62
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,439
I know...

63
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,360
that lying to you...

64
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,439
will get me killed.

65
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,519
I truly don't know!

66
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,519
Even if you kill me,

67
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:38,200
there's nothing I can say.

68
00:08:44,279 --> 00:08:44,919
Fine.

69
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,799
Since you're so eager to die,

70
00:08:52,559 --> 00:08:54,080
I'll grant your wish.

71
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,639
Grant whose wish?

72
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:04,159
Boss Ma.

73
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:08,840
You kept me waiting, Boss Ma.

74
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,240
Boss Nan.

75
00:09:12,559 --> 00:09:13,960
Acting so familiar...

76
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:16,159
Are we that close?

77
00:09:16,559 --> 00:09:17,600
Clueless idiot.

78
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,879
Call him Boss Xiang.

79
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:20,919
Boss Xiang.

80
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,080
Boss Xiang,

81
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:25,080
you're looking great.

82
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:27,519
Lady Luck must be shining on you.

83
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,519
Compared to you, Boss Ma,

84
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:33,200
my luck's just a tiny bit better.

85
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,120
Xiaotian.

86
00:10:14,679 --> 00:10:15,639
Well, Boss Ma?

87
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:17,559
The boss treats you well, doesn't he?

88
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:19,360
This batch...

89
00:10:19,879 --> 00:10:22,200
...is nearly 99 percent pure.

90
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,840
Take this,

91
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,679
and you'll make at least ten percent more.

92
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,919
Looks like you're going to strike it rich.

93
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,080
Boss Xiang,

94
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:33,120
we're both just working for the boss.

95
00:10:33,519 --> 00:10:34,960
Here are the goods.

96
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:36,840
Keep them safe.

97
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:38,600
Will do.

98
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:40,799
Hey, pal.

99
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,320
You got the bag dirty.

100
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:43,200
Wipe it off.

101
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:49,639
Boss Ma,

102
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,279
is he your boy?

103
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:54,919
No.

104
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,159
You people...

105
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:07,200
...always love to talk about...

106
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:09,600
...brothers, pals, and friends.

107
00:11:10,519 --> 00:11:13,279
As if being friends gives you an excuse to screw people over.

108
00:11:14,159 --> 00:11:16,879
Your boss ran off with 5 million worth of my goods.

109
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,159
Boss Ma,

110
00:11:21,919 --> 00:11:23,559
who do you think I should go after?

111
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,200
Boss Xiang made it very clear.

112
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:29,440
His boss ran off with your goods.

113
00:11:29,639 --> 00:11:33,000
So there's no need for you to take it out on an underling.

114
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,159
Boss Ma is right.

115
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:37,840
When trouble comes, the boss takes the heat.

116
00:11:38,279 --> 00:11:40,159
Why should an underling take the blame?

117
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:45,279
Since Boss Ma pleaded for you,

118
00:11:45,879 --> 00:11:47,279
I'll spare your life.

119
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,240
Thank you, Boss Ma!

120
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:52,200
How about it, Boss Ma?

121
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,080
Name a price.

122
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:55,559
How much will you pay to buy this kid's life?

123
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:06,519
You're joking, Boss Xiang.

124
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:08,600
Do I look like I'm joking?

125
00:12:15,519 --> 00:12:17,480
You can eat whatever you want,

126
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,879
but you'd better watch what you say.

127
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,039
Since you've already pleaded for him,

128
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:23,879
you've got to back it up with action.

129
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,320
What do you mean?

130
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,559
My apologies,

131
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:35,440
Boss Xiang.

132
00:12:36,039 --> 00:12:38,039
I was out of line.

133
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:41,320
I hope you can overlook it.

134
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,919
Just talking. No need to be so tense.

135
00:12:46,399 --> 00:12:47,440
But I really do plan...

136
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,440
...to put this kid's life in your hands.

137
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:51,600
Think it over, Boss Ma.

138
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,879
Will you pay to buy his life,

139
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,759
or kill him with your own hands?

140
00:12:56,559 --> 00:12:57,279
Your call.

141
00:13:23,879 --> 00:13:25,879
You really need me to get my hands dirty for this?

142
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:39,799
Every wrong has its culprit,

143
00:13:41,039 --> 00:13:42,240
every debt its debtor.

144
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:46,440
Once you're a ghost,

145
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:49,360
go haunt whoever you want.

146
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,279
Boss Ma.

147
00:14:10,799 --> 00:14:11,240
Let's go.

148
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,399
In less than a month,

149
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:28,960
multiple drug cases occurred in Nanhai City,

150
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:30,919
severely impacting

151
00:14:30,919 --> 00:14:32,320
our city's public security.

152
00:14:33,559 --> 00:14:34,480
Starting today,

153
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:36,279
we're fighting a tough, decisive battle.

154
00:14:37,399 --> 00:14:38,399
Next, the Criminal Investigation Division

155
00:14:38,399 --> 00:14:39,840
will brief us on the other two cases.

156
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,519
Just a moment, please.

157
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:43,600
Switch to the Qinyi Garden case, please.

158
00:14:46,759 --> 00:14:48,639
The victim was Qu Li from Shandong,

159
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:51,639
who had lived in Qinyi Garden for under three months.

160
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:54,279
According to our canvassing,

161
00:14:54,879 --> 00:14:57,759
the victim was involved in sex work.

162
00:14:57,840 --> 00:15:00,240
Through our investigation of the scene

163
00:15:00,919 --> 00:15:03,559
and physical evidence analysis,

164
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:07,120
her blood samples revealed

165
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,679
that she had used heroin that day.

166
00:15:10,039 --> 00:15:11,879
Furthermore, in the victim's apartment,

167
00:15:12,039 --> 00:15:14,440
we found packaging for Psychedelic Blues

168
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:15,879
and traces of consumption.

169
00:15:16,039 --> 00:15:18,440
This was likely left by the fleeing suspect.

170
00:15:19,279 --> 00:15:20,399
We can confirm for now

171
00:15:20,639 --> 00:15:22,799
that the victim and the fleeing suspect

172
00:15:22,799 --> 00:15:24,200
definitely knew each other.

173
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,480
On the day of the incident,

174
00:15:26,639 --> 00:15:27,799
Li Xiao from the Narcotics Squad

175
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,399
was near the crime scene by chance.

176
00:15:34,679 --> 00:15:35,840
Because of Li Xiao's disruption,

177
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,720
the panicked suspect likely

178
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:40,799
left behind evidence.

179
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,200
That's why I suspect

180
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:43,799
the suspect

181
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:46,480
might return to the crime scene

182
00:15:46,879 --> 00:15:49,480
to destroy any evidence left behind.

183
00:15:51,799 --> 00:15:52,399
Boss,

184
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:55,559
that punk Xiang Nan is getting way too cocky.

185
00:15:55,799 --> 00:15:56,720
Damn right, Boss.

186
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,679
Should we find a chance to take him out?

187
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,279
His older brother, Xiang Dong,

188
00:16:02,879 --> 00:16:04,000
goes by Piyazi.

189
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,480
He's close to the boss.

190
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,159
Our supply

191
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:10,559
comes through the two of them.

192
00:16:10,679 --> 00:16:11,840
If we touch his brother,

193
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,279
it'll get us all killed.

194
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:15,960
Boss,

195
00:16:17,799 --> 00:16:19,399
what if we bypass the brothers

196
00:16:19,399 --> 00:16:20,840
and get goods straight from the boss?

197
00:16:22,799 --> 00:16:24,360
But we don't know who the boss is.

198
00:16:28,399 --> 00:16:29,000
A-Qiang,

199
00:16:29,639 --> 00:16:31,159
keep an eye on Wu Liang these next few days.

200
00:16:31,679 --> 00:16:34,120
Have him unload the five million in goods ASAP.

201
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:37,240
You guys are heading to Country M with me soon.

202
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:39,480
Once I set up the route in Country M,

203
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:41,320
we can cut Piyazi out

204
00:16:41,399 --> 00:16:42,440
and do this on our own.

205
00:16:42,559 --> 00:16:43,080
Sounds good.

206
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,639
Hustle hard for a few years,

207
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,799
make enough cash,

208
00:16:47,519 --> 00:16:48,600
and we'll get out of here.

209
00:16:49,039 --> 00:16:49,600
Boss,

210
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:50,679
how about...

211
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,240
we move abroad?

212
00:16:52,399 --> 00:16:53,360
Sure, why not?

213
00:16:54,759 --> 00:16:56,200
Then abroad it is.

214
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,440
Moving abroad.

215
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:10,119
This Wednesday,

216
00:17:10,119 --> 00:17:12,680
a severe crash occurred on the Ring Expressway.

217
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:16,519
A Porsche SUV, plate number Nan A7975,

218
00:17:16,559 --> 00:17:17,599
broke through the median barrier

219
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:22,000
and struck a Toyota sedan, plate 9276M.

220
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,480
The driver of the Porsche, Wang Xiao,

221
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:26,519
was formerly employed by Longze Group

222
00:17:26,519 --> 00:17:27,640
as the deputy head of security.

223
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,400
Within 15 minutes of the collision,

224
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,920
the Porsche was set ablaze.

225
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:34,720
Evidence from the scene suggests

226
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,079
it is highly likely

227
00:17:36,079 --> 00:17:38,559
to be a case of intentional arson.

228
00:17:40,279 --> 00:17:41,599
Inside the Porsche,

229
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:44,079
we found burned remnants of tin foil.

230
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,440
Based on the code printed on it,

231
00:17:46,960 --> 00:17:47,680
we determined

232
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:50,720
that during our raid on Xiangdu Entertainment Club,

233
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:53,400
the Psychedelic Blues seized there

234
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:54,799
used the exact same foil packaging.

235
00:17:55,359 --> 00:17:56,880
Therefore, we suspect

236
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:59,480
Wang Xiao was likely a drug smuggler.

237
00:18:01,039 --> 00:18:01,680
Chief,

238
00:18:02,519 --> 00:18:03,599
our Narcotics Division

239
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,839
also has other leads regarding the arson

240
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,319
and the fatal fall.

241
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,119
Let's hear them.

242
00:18:09,799 --> 00:18:12,799
According to the addicts at Xiangdu Entertainment Club,

243
00:18:13,079 --> 00:18:14,440
the drugs in their possession

244
00:18:14,599 --> 00:18:15,880
were purchased from prostitutes

245
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,079
who frequented the club.

246
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,039
And the drugs in their hands

247
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:21,319
all originated from a man named Wu Liang.

248
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,119
As for this Wu Liang,

249
00:18:22,119 --> 00:18:24,319
he used to be a security guard at Longze Group.

250
00:18:25,079 --> 00:18:27,039
Connecting this to the arson case,

251
00:18:27,759 --> 00:18:28,960
we cannot help but suspect

252
00:18:29,119 --> 00:18:31,759
that between Longze Group and Psychedelic Blues,

253
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,839
there is some underlying connection.

254
00:18:34,839 --> 00:18:35,720
Meanwhile,

255
00:18:35,799 --> 00:18:37,839
while investigating the prostitutes

256
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,079
at Xiangdu Entertainment Club,

257
00:18:39,599 --> 00:18:40,400
we discovered by chance

258
00:18:40,519 --> 00:18:43,440
that Qu Li, the victim of the fatal fall at Qinyi Garden,

259
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:46,200
had also worked as a prostitute at this club.

260
00:18:46,359 --> 00:18:47,319
From the looks of it,

261
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,240
Xiangdu Entertainment Club

262
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:51,960
is likely the main dealing hub for Psychedelic Blues.

263
00:18:52,799 --> 00:18:53,440
The Narcotics Division

264
00:18:53,599 --> 00:18:55,519
will lead the investigation into these three cases,

265
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:58,079
with Criminal Investigation providing support.

266
00:18:58,640 --> 00:18:59,279
Any objections?

267
00:19:00,359 --> 00:19:01,079
None.

268
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:06,279
Well...

269
00:19:06,799 --> 00:19:07,319
Chief,

270
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:11,839
over the past two years, our Narcotics Division

271
00:19:12,039 --> 00:19:14,519
has run over a hundred operations, big and small.

272
00:19:14,559 --> 00:19:17,279
Many of our officers have had their covers blown.

273
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,680
Just verbal support from you

274
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:20,880
won't cut it.

275
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:26,440
At most,

276
00:19:27,119 --> 00:19:28,200
I can only give you one spot.

277
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:29,519
Otherwise,

278
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,400
take someone from Criminal Investigation.

279
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:34,440
Thank you, Chief.

280
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,279
I want Zhuang Yan.

281
00:19:40,319 --> 00:19:40,960
You want who?

282
00:19:41,359 --> 00:19:42,160
Zhuang Yan.

283
00:20:07,519 --> 00:20:08,279
Out of the way!

284
00:20:30,519 --> 00:20:31,000
Stop!

285
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:34,960
Stay back!

286
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:35,960
Don't kill me!

287
00:20:36,279 --> 00:20:37,359
Drop the knife!

288
00:20:38,079 --> 00:20:39,079
Don't kill me!

289
00:20:39,079 --> 00:20:39,559
Stay back!

290
00:20:39,759 --> 00:20:40,920
Come any closer and I'll kill her!

291
00:20:42,079 --> 00:20:43,839
Don't kill me! Please don't kill me!

292
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:46,160
Help!

293
00:20:47,799 --> 00:20:49,400
Save me!

294
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:52,079
Help!

295
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:57,640
Drop the gun!

296
00:20:58,240 --> 00:21:00,119
I'll count to three. Drop the gun!

297
00:21:00,799 --> 00:21:01,400
One!

298
00:21:01,839 --> 00:21:02,680
Two!

299
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:03,599
Help me!

300
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:05,599
Three!

301
00:21:17,079 --> 00:21:18,599
How many times have I told you?

302
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,839
Unless it's an absolute last resort,

303
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,599
don't shoot! Don't shoot!

304
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,279
Why won't you ever listen?

305
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:26,799
Reporting, Captain.

306
00:21:27,079 --> 00:21:27,839
this suspect

307
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,480
fled after committing intentional assault.

308
00:21:29,599 --> 00:21:30,640
If I hadn't taken decisive action,

309
00:21:30,839 --> 00:21:31,960
the hostage would've been harmed.

310
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:32,839
Sure.

311
00:21:33,279 --> 00:21:35,000
But what if you had hit the hostage?

312
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:35,599
What then?

313
00:21:35,599 --> 00:21:37,960
It takes only 0.5 seconds for him to strike.

314
00:21:38,599 --> 00:21:40,759
I was less than ten meters from the suspect.

315
00:21:41,119 --> 00:21:43,519
A bullet travels at 450 meters per second.

316
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,680
All I had to do was wait for him to count to three,

317
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:46,839
and pull the trigger.

318
00:21:47,039 --> 00:21:48,400
That would keep the hostage safe

319
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:49,519
and prevent any mistakes.

320
00:21:50,319 --> 00:21:51,480
All right, all right.

321
00:21:51,839 --> 00:21:53,119
I know you're good.

322
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,359
I know you're a great shot.

323
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:57,160
Don't let it happen again.

324
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:01,160
Enough.

325
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,440
Leave things here to me.

326
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:04,400
Head over to Narcotics right away,

327
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,279
and report to Captain Bai.

328
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:06,000
Yes, sir!

329
00:22:25,720 --> 00:22:27,720
Hello, is Captain Bai in?

330
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:33,039
Zhuang Yan.

331
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:34,960
The great Officer Zhuang.

332
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:37,920
What brings you to Narcotics?

333
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:39,960
Captain Bai told me to report here.

334
00:22:40,799 --> 00:22:42,599
And... do I know you?

335
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,359
Who doesn't know you?

336
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:50,640
Criminal Investigation's very own...

337
00:22:50,799 --> 00:22:51,960
Zhuang Yan, the great Officer Zhuang.

338
00:22:52,799 --> 00:22:53,839
The Daredevil.

339
00:22:54,359 --> 00:22:55,279
The sharpest mind.

340
00:22:55,359 --> 00:22:57,079
Three-time combat champion.

341
00:22:57,279 --> 00:22:58,720
Two-time shooting champion.

342
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,720
That's you, right?

343
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:03,480
That's me.

344
00:23:04,559 --> 00:23:05,400
And you are...?

345
00:23:05,799 --> 00:23:07,160
Whatever Narcotics has to deal with,

346
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:08,759
we can handle ourselves.

347
00:23:09,079 --> 00:23:11,759
So you can go back to where you came from.

348
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:28,279
Captain Bai specifically asked for me in Narcotics.

349
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:31,119
If you have a problem with that, take it up with him.

350
00:23:34,799 --> 00:23:36,319
Three-time combat champion, huh?

351
00:23:38,319 --> 00:23:39,480
Only because I wasn't there.

352
00:23:41,079 --> 00:23:43,039
Fine. Come with me to see Captain Bai.

353
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:44,759
I'll show Captain Bai

354
00:23:45,799 --> 00:23:47,480
that not just anyone

355
00:23:50,519 --> 00:23:51,680
can join Narcotics.

356
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:03,440
These are files on cases our division solved

357
00:24:03,519 --> 00:24:05,960
over the past five years.

358
00:24:06,759 --> 00:24:08,720
Take a week to familiarize yourself with them.

359
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:11,200
If you have questions, ask Li Xiao,

360
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:15,200
or look up the details in the archives.

361
00:24:16,599 --> 00:24:17,119
Captain Bai.

362
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:19,960
Going through all this will take him a whole week.

363
00:24:20,759 --> 00:24:23,960
When can he actually start missions with us?

364
00:24:24,799 --> 00:24:26,400
Your mission starts tomorrow.

365
00:24:26,799 --> 00:24:29,240
He's to study these at the same time.

366
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,039
I'm good with that.

367
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,160
Do you have a problem?

368
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,920
If he's fine with it, so am I.

369
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:43,559
So,

370
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:45,680
what's our mission?

371
00:24:49,440 --> 00:24:51,079
This man is Wu Liang.

372
00:24:51,920 --> 00:24:53,480
He's the prime suspect

373
00:24:53,759 --> 00:24:55,279
in the Xiangdu Entertainment Club drug case.

374
00:24:55,759 --> 00:24:57,759
He used to be a security guard at Longze Group.

375
00:24:58,599 --> 00:25:01,640
We now suspect the fatal fall at Qinyi Garden

376
00:25:02,039 --> 00:25:04,720
is tied to the Xiangdu Entertainment Club drug case.

377
00:25:05,839 --> 00:25:06,519
Wu Liang is

378
00:25:07,799 --> 00:25:08,640
our breakthrough.

379
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:14,160
For this operation,

380
00:25:17,359 --> 00:25:18,200
Zhuang Yan is in charge.

381
00:25:23,359 --> 00:25:24,039
Understood.

382
00:25:28,559 --> 00:25:29,160
Captain...

383
00:25:32,599 --> 00:25:33,559
Captain Bai, why?

384
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:36,119
Why are you putting a rookie in charge?

385
00:25:36,599 --> 00:25:37,240
Got a problem with that?

386
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:39,240
Reporting, Captain. Yes, I do!

387
00:25:40,359 --> 00:25:40,839
Suck it up.

388
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:28,599
Mr. Qin.

389
00:26:30,599 --> 00:26:33,720
The cops already raided Xiangdu Entertainment Club,

390
00:26:33,799 --> 00:26:36,079
yet you seem pretty relaxed.

391
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:38,559
Mr. Qin,

392
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:40,400
I moved the stash.

393
00:26:40,799 --> 00:26:41,440
It's safe.

394
00:26:47,799 --> 00:26:49,759
It's already been two days.

395
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:52,720
So when do you plan to deliver the goods?

396
00:26:52,759 --> 00:26:53,960
Give it another two days.

397
00:26:55,799 --> 00:26:57,160
The heat is too intense right now.

398
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:58,359
My hands are tied.

399
00:27:00,839 --> 00:27:02,759
What's that supposed to mean?

400
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:05,240
Want me to solve this for you?

401
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:12,960
Mr. Qin!

402
00:27:13,359 --> 00:27:13,920
Mr. Qin!

403
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:15,559
Just give me two more days!

404
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:20,039
I swear I'll get the goods to you in two days!

405
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:22,319
Do you really think I still trust you?

406
00:27:27,839 --> 00:27:28,359
Wait.

407
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:30,240
Boss,

408
00:27:30,759 --> 00:27:31,559
getting the goods is what matters.

409
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,319
Why not give him two more days?

410
00:27:36,559 --> 00:27:38,799
Fine. We'll do what A-Kai says.

411
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:40,559
Two more days.

412
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:41,759
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

413
00:27:50,920 --> 00:27:53,000
Are you insane?

414
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:56,440
If I don't get the goods in two days,

415
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:58,480
have someone ready to collect your corpse.

416
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,960
Based on our investigation,

417
00:28:32,039 --> 00:28:33,400
we suspect Wu Liang has

418
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:34,519
lost a batch of drugs.

419
00:28:34,799 --> 00:28:36,480
He wants to get them back,

420
00:28:36,640 --> 00:28:37,240
which is why

421
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:39,079
he went to those three for help.

422
00:28:39,319 --> 00:28:40,559
Right now, Wu Liang

423
00:28:40,559 --> 00:28:41,559
is completely isolated.

424
00:28:41,559 --> 00:28:43,119
He will definitely look for other ways.

425
00:28:43,559 --> 00:28:45,279
Many of Wu Liang's individual buyers

426
00:28:45,279 --> 00:28:46,359
have frequented Xiangdu Entertainment Club.

427
00:28:46,400 --> 00:28:48,079
So if we follow this lead,

428
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,359
we can definitely take down

429
00:28:49,359 --> 00:28:51,519
the Psychedelic Blues distribution network.

430
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:55,799
The top priority now is capturing Wu Liang

431
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:57,920
and exposing the crime syndicate behind him.

432
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:58,480
Right.

433
00:29:03,759 --> 00:29:04,279
Bo.

434
00:29:05,039 --> 00:29:05,880
Stop eating.

435
00:29:06,799 --> 00:29:07,400
What do you have?

436
00:29:11,039 --> 00:29:12,079
Last week,

437
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:14,160
there was an arson on the Ring Expressway,

438
00:29:14,720 --> 00:29:17,279
and a fatal fall at Qinyi Garden.

439
00:29:17,599 --> 00:29:18,920
The arson victim

440
00:29:19,480 --> 00:29:20,920
was a security guard from Longze Group.

441
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:28,680
I suspect Wu Liang is the arsonist.

442
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:32,519
You and Zhuang Yan seem to think alike.

443
00:29:33,759 --> 00:29:34,799
He's way sharper than me.

444
00:29:35,119 --> 00:29:37,039
He doesn't need to snack while thinking.

445
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:41,799
Where is Zhuang Yan?

446
00:29:45,079 --> 00:29:46,839
He was sorting files until late last night.

447
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:49,200
I told him to head to Traffic after waking up

448
00:29:49,279 --> 00:29:51,759
to check the surveillance footage from that day,

449
00:29:51,960 --> 00:29:53,519
and see if he can find any new leads.

450
00:30:01,279 --> 00:30:02,000
Pause it.

451
00:30:02,599 --> 00:30:03,400
Rewind from here.

452
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:07,839
Rewind a bit more.

453
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:16,680
At this exact time, this Volkswagen CC

454
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:17,880
entered the Ring Expressway.

455
00:30:18,319 --> 00:30:20,519
Twenty minutes later, it exited via Exit 4.

456
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,480
When the Porsche erupted in flames,

457
00:30:23,079 --> 00:30:24,720
this car happened to pass right by it.

458
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:26,920
They didn't help or call the police.

459
00:30:27,759 --> 00:30:28,519
Keep tracking it.

460
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,039
Find where this car went.

461
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:41,440
After the CC entered Linyin Street off Jing'an Road,

462
00:30:41,599 --> 00:30:43,039
it stayed there for over 40 minutes.

463
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:45,440
Then it got onto West Ring Road,

464
00:30:45,920 --> 00:30:47,480
entered the Xinqiao Expressway ramp,

465
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,519
and left the city.

466
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:50,519
For that forty-minute window,

467
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:52,039
pull up all the Jing'an Road intersection cameras.

468
00:30:52,119 --> 00:30:52,680
Retrieve everything.

469
00:30:52,960 --> 00:30:53,519
On it.

470
00:31:05,279 --> 00:31:06,799
Stop. Rewind from here.

471
00:31:07,279 --> 00:31:08,799
Right. Play it in slow motion.

472
00:31:11,039 --> 00:31:11,519
Zoom in.

473
00:31:24,440 --> 00:31:25,799
According to traffic surveillance,

474
00:31:26,119 --> 00:31:27,720
Wu Liang actually went to Linyin Street, too.

475
00:31:27,960 --> 00:31:29,440
And when he left,

476
00:31:29,680 --> 00:31:31,599
he had a black backpack with him.

477
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,759
Based on our earlier leads,

478
00:31:34,559 --> 00:31:36,960
the Porsche was carrying a drug shipment

479
00:31:36,960 --> 00:31:37,640
into our city that day.

480
00:31:37,759 --> 00:31:40,200
The driver, Wang Xiao, overdosed on drugs,

481
00:31:40,319 --> 00:31:41,200
crashed through the median barrier,

482
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,319
and collided with the Toyota.

483
00:31:42,319 --> 00:31:44,240
Later, highway surveillance revealed

484
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,519
there was a black backpack

485
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:48,880
nearly identical to the one Wu Liang carried.

486
00:31:49,359 --> 00:31:50,400
So I suspect

487
00:31:50,559 --> 00:31:52,319
someone arrived at the scene immediately,

488
00:31:52,359 --> 00:31:54,079
took the drugs from inside the Porsche,

489
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:55,319
and handed them over to Wu Liang.

490
00:31:55,799 --> 00:31:57,519
Then on the 23rd,

491
00:31:57,519 --> 00:31:58,720
Wu Liang lost the shipment.

492
00:32:01,079 --> 00:32:02,200
Which means

493
00:32:02,359 --> 00:32:04,799
Wu Liang wasn't the arsonist on the highway.

494
00:32:07,920 --> 00:32:10,920
If the drugs were really lost on Wu Liang's watch,

495
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:13,480
that's definitely a serious issue.

496
00:32:15,160 --> 00:32:17,200
Still, I don't think it's that simple.

497
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:25,680
We got word

498
00:32:25,799 --> 00:32:27,279
that Wu Liang is heading to Qinyi Garden

499
00:32:27,759 --> 00:32:30,039
for the one kilogram of Psychedelic Blues he hid.

500
00:32:30,119 --> 00:32:31,680
He's already found backup for this.

501
00:32:32,519 --> 00:32:35,480
We also confirmed with the Jinzhou police earlier

502
00:32:36,599 --> 00:32:39,119
that their key local trafficker, Qin Hao,

503
00:32:39,319 --> 00:32:40,680
has already arrived in Nanhai.

504
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:44,720
Chief, regarding the operation to arrest Wu Liang,

505
00:32:44,920 --> 00:32:46,400
I have a bold idea.

506
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:47,920
Go ahead.

507
00:32:48,279 --> 00:32:52,440
Developing and launching a new drug,

508
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:55,559
not to mention building distribution networks...

509
00:32:55,799 --> 00:32:56,519
I don't think

510
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:59,079
that's something a single gang could pull off.

511
00:32:59,839 --> 00:33:03,119
There must be a powerful syndicate

512
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:03,759
backing them.

513
00:33:04,319 --> 00:33:05,359
In my opinion,

514
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:07,279
instead of arresting Wu Liang now,

515
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:09,039
we should use him as bait

516
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:11,039
to draw out the syndicate behind him.

517
00:33:13,440 --> 00:33:15,119
If we let Wu Liang go,

518
00:33:15,920 --> 00:33:18,640
we can hardly keep everything under control.

519
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:20,519
How confident are you?

520
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,160
I don't know.

521
00:33:33,119 --> 00:33:34,559
But over the past six months,

522
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:36,759
our Narcotics Division and Criminal Investigation

523
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:38,759
have poured in massive manpower and resources

524
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:40,640
just to track down Wu Liang.

525
00:33:41,039 --> 00:33:42,920
If we don't follow this lead through,

526
00:33:43,599 --> 00:33:44,720
it would be such a waste.

527
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:53,240
Chief Huang, Criminal Investigation

528
00:33:53,680 --> 00:33:55,720
is willing to allocate extra officers

529
00:33:56,440 --> 00:33:57,519
to fully back the Narcotics Division.

530
00:33:59,079 --> 00:33:59,559
Chief.

531
00:34:24,960 --> 00:34:26,199
Taking a small risk for a big payoff—

532
00:34:26,639 --> 00:34:27,880
it's well worth it.

533
00:34:29,119 --> 00:34:31,800
At least we can take down a kingpin like Qin Hao first.

534
00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:36,960
Moving forward, you'll be on the front lines,

535
00:34:37,440 --> 00:34:39,159
facing all kinds of challenges.

536
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:42,880
Give it your all.

537
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:44,519
Whatever happens,

538
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:45,960
I'll take full responsibility.

539
00:34:47,679 --> 00:34:48,800
Thank you, Chief. Thank you.

540
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:50,159
Luring the snake out of its hole

541
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:53,159
means striking an even bigger kingpin with lightning speed.

542
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:54,800
That's why the codename for this mission

543
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:56,679
is Operation Thunderbolt.

544
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:57,480
Yes, sir!

545
00:34:59,159 --> 00:35:00,840
The GPS tracking device

546
00:35:00,840 --> 00:35:02,280
has already been hidden inside the drugs.

547
00:35:02,639 --> 00:35:05,000
Before the operation, Zhuang Yan and Li Xiao

548
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:07,079
will return the drugs to Qu Li's home.

549
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:09,760
CID has already dispatched officers

550
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:12,119
to keep 24-hour surveillance on Qinyi Garden.

551
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:15,920
The objective is to stage an arrest of Wu Liang.

552
00:35:16,159 --> 00:35:18,159
Li Xiao and Zhuang Yan will keep eyes on Wu Liang,

553
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:20,440
and let him escape at the right moment,

554
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:23,079
forcing him to contact the buyer immediately,

555
00:35:23,079 --> 00:35:25,119
which will flush out the bigger traffickers.

556
00:35:29,599 --> 00:35:30,039
Team A,

557
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:31,039
report your status.

558
00:35:31,320 --> 00:35:33,559
Surveillance installed. Please confirm connection.

559
00:35:41,199 --> 00:35:42,119
Signal connected.

560
00:36:00,159 --> 00:36:01,119
Team A, pull out immediately.

561
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:03,599
Move to the designated point and await orders.

562
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:05,000
Copy that.

563
00:36:11,000 --> 00:36:12,639
Do you think the suspect...

564
00:36:13,519 --> 00:36:14,880
...will abandon this shipment?

565
00:36:15,559 --> 00:36:16,039
He won't.

566
00:36:16,079 --> 00:36:17,440
Wu Liang is like a cornered dog now,

567
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,159
with nowhere left to run.

568
00:36:18,239 --> 00:36:20,119
He'll definitely come back for this shipment.

569
00:36:42,039 --> 00:36:42,599
Captain Bai.

570
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:43,960
Suspicious individuals spotted.

571
00:36:44,039 --> 00:36:44,840
A man and a woman.

572
00:36:46,119 --> 00:36:46,559
Xiao Ding.

573
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:57,519
All units, be advised.

574
00:36:58,039 --> 00:36:59,000
Suspect spotted.

575
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:00,400
Try another pose.

576
00:37:54,480 --> 00:37:55,119
Team A, be advised.

577
00:37:55,119 --> 00:37:57,119
Three suspects have entered the building.

578
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:57,880
Copy that.

579
00:39:51,199 --> 00:39:52,039
It's an ambush!

580
00:39:54,199 --> 00:39:54,719
Move in!

581
00:39:55,880 --> 00:39:56,639
Police! Don't move!

582
00:39:57,599 --> 00:39:58,039
Police!

583
00:40:05,159 --> 00:40:05,719
Freeze!

584
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:10,920
Don't run!

585
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:12,960
Stop right there!

586
00:40:16,079 --> 00:40:16,360
Don't move!

587
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:16,719
Stop!

588
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:17,199
Move, move!

589
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:17,760
Freeze!

590
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:27,440
Let him go downstairs.

591
00:40:27,960 --> 00:40:28,239
Move!

592
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:37,239
Xiao Ding, keep eyes on the suspect.

593
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:37,760
Copy that.

594
00:40:50,760 --> 00:40:51,800
If we make it out alive,

595
00:40:52,159 --> 00:40:53,360
meet at the usual spot by the exit.

596
00:40:54,159 --> 00:40:55,920
There's a contact named Lao Jin in my phone.

597
00:40:56,639 --> 00:40:57,719
If I don't get away,

598
00:40:58,119 --> 00:40:59,519
give my cut to Lao Jin.

599
00:41:03,519 --> 00:41:03,880
Team C,

600
00:41:04,079 --> 00:41:04,559
move in.

601
00:41:04,559 --> 00:41:05,079
Copy that.

602
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:13,360
Freeze!

603
00:41:16,920 --> 00:41:17,840
Stop or I'll shoot!

604
00:41:20,679 --> 00:41:21,199
Stop!

605
00:41:23,400 --> 00:41:23,960
Don't run!

606
00:41:24,039 --> 00:41:24,599
Freeze!

607
00:41:24,679 --> 00:41:25,119
Stop right there!

608
00:41:27,559 --> 00:41:28,159
Captain Bai,

609
00:41:28,559 --> 00:41:30,119
the suspect is driving a white Honda.

610
00:41:30,719 --> 00:41:31,400
After him!

611
00:42:21,239 --> 00:42:22,039
Don't move!

612
00:42:23,519 --> 00:42:24,480
Move, and she's dead!

613
00:42:25,000 --> 00:42:25,760
Drop the gun!

614
00:42:25,760 --> 00:42:26,599
Drop the gun!

615
00:42:26,840 --> 00:42:27,920
Put your guns down!

616
00:42:37,679 --> 00:42:39,639
Suspect is driving a white Honda,

617
00:42:39,639 --> 00:42:41,159
fleeing through the north gate.

618
00:42:41,320 --> 00:42:42,840
All units, move in to intercept!

619
00:42:49,079 --> 00:42:51,119
Drop your gun now, and we'll let you go!

620
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:52,519
Drop your guns,

621
00:42:52,599 --> 00:42:53,840
and I'll let her go!

622
00:42:55,239 --> 00:42:56,000
Lower them!

623
00:42:59,760 --> 00:43:00,519
Three.

624
00:43:03,440 --> 00:43:03,880
Two.

625
00:43:03,920 --> 00:43:04,519
Zhuang Yan!

626
00:43:06,719 --> 00:43:07,320
Zhuang Yan!
